# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# GitHub Pages publishes everything committed in this repo, and this
# folder is also used as a working directory for legal and client work.
# These patterns keep contracts, BAAs, redlines and drafts out of the
# public site. Verified 2026-09-09: the site itself references no local
# .pdf or .docx, only external menopause.org citations.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
*.docx
*.pdf
*.bak
*.bak.html
*.pre-skin-*.html
*.diff
RECAP-*.md
*-DRAFT-*.md
*Agreement*
*Disposition-Chart*
*Amendment-No*
*REDLINE*
*-CLEAN.docx
.claude/
.impeccable/
*.xlsx
*-Memo-*.md
make_*.py
negotiation-menu.html
whop-verify-results.json
tiers-*.png
